        "text": "={{ \n\"Analyze the following text directly. It is already provided here. Do not access LinkedIn, browse the internet, or ask me for more information.\\n\\nPOST CONTENT:\\n\"\n+ $('AI Agent').first().json.output\n+ \"\\n\\nCreate a detailed visual description representing the exact topic and key ideas in this post. Specify concrete objects, visual elements, and their arrangement. Use a premium, modern professional editorial illustration style. Avoid unrelated subjects, generic businesspeople, random robots, and unnecessary text. Return only the image-generation prompt.\"\n}}",
